  "notes": "The MEPSTA Annuaire Statistique 2016/2017 confirms the structure: Fondamental 1 of six years (CI, CP, CE1, CE2, CM1, CM2) ending with the CEF 1, Fondamental 2 of four years (6ème–3ème) ending with the Brevet des Collèges, and secondary of three years (2nde, 1ère, Tle, series A–D) ending with the Baccalauréat. Entry at 6 and the concours d'entrée en 6ème are from the ISCED 2011 mapping for the Central African Republic cited here, which names the exams CEPE and BEPC; no official source confirms them."
